> - 操作类：收缩(shrink), 膨胀(dilate), 裁剪(crop), 提取(extract), 透明叠加(transparent_overlay), 重涂色(recolor), 旋转(rotate), 拼接(concatenate), 平移对齐(translate_align), 擦除(erase), 连通判定(connectivity_test), 连通检测(connected_component_detection), 筛选(filtering), 纯色填充(solid_color_fill), 形状匹配(shape_matching), 滑动(sliding), 复制(copy), 填充(fill), 平移(translate), 排序(sort), 洪泛填充(flood_fill), 同心层填充(concentric_fill), 连线(connect), 射线延伸(ray_extend), 像素放大(pixel_upscale), 补全(completion), 平铺(tile), 计数(counting), 拼图组装(jigsaw_assemble), 对称补全(symmetric_complete)
> - 对象类：菱形轮廓(diamond_outline), 双色图像(bicolor_image), 面板(panel), 分隔列(separator_col), 前景掩码(fg_mask), 完整网格(full_grid), 边框(frame), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 空心矩形(hollow_rectangle), 十字图案(cross_pattern), 前景对象(foreground_object), 桥接路径(bridge_path), 单色连通体(monochromatic_connected_object), 精灵体(sprite), 图例区域(legend_region), 分隔线(divider), 条形障碍(bar_obstacle), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 孔洞(hole), 边框方块(bordered_square), 网格边缘(grid_edge), 迷宫走廊(maze_corridor), 种子像素(seed_pixel), 同心正方形层(concentric_layer), 对角像素对(diagonal_pixel_pair), 触发像素(trigger_pixel), 顶行色带(top_row_band), 收缩楔形(shrinking_wedge), 画布(canvas), 基底像素(substrate_pixel), 碎片(fragment), 角标记(corner_marker)
> - 空间关系类：颜色决定操作(color_det_operation), 对齐(alignment), 副本堆叠(copy_stacking), 角落对齐(corner_alignment), 连通性(connectivity), 接触停止(contact_stop), 内部包含(containment), 颜色决定目标(color_determines_destination), 路径连通(path_connectivity), 嵌套层次(nesting_hierarchy), 对角对齐(diagonal_alignment), 沿对角线传播(diagonal_propagate), 逐像素映射(per_pixel_mapping), 行列对齐(row_col_alignment), 包围(enclosure), 阵列排布(array_layout), 镜像对称(mirror_symmetry)
> - 条件/判断类：半径微调(radius_adjust), 行列乘积完整(row_col_product), 双面背景交集标记(both_bg_intersect_mark), 最近角定背景(nearest_corner_bg), 移到边框角(move_to_frame_corner), 连通输出色否则黑(connected_color_else_black), 唯一连通分量(unique_component), 最大面积选择(largest_area_selection), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 旋转反射等价(rotation_reflection_equivalence), 碰触后对侧放副本(touch_copy_opposite), 仅正方形孔洞填充(only_square_holes_filled), 孔洞几何决定填充(hole_geometry_sets_fill), 行重叠内移(row_overlap_shifts_inward), 距离优先排序(distance_priority_ordering), 路径奇偶交替涂色(alternating_color_by_path_parity), 按距离循环配色(distance_color_cycling), 触发点分束(trigger_splits_beam), 逐行交换双色(row_swap_bicolor), 每像素扩展为色块(each_pixel_expanded_to_block), 标记推断十字涂底(marker_cross_recolor), 面积决定填充色(area_determines_fill_color), 像素数定尺寸数(pixel_count_sets_size_copies), 同色不相邻(same_color_no_touch)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

